{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":1436,"chapterID":7,"chapterNumber":"7","sectionNumber":"722.4.2","title":"722.4.2 Multi-wythe walls.","sourceHTMLPath":"code-sections/building-code/chapters/7.html","blocks":[{"id":"1436-html-1","kind":"html","html":"</div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170572\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170572\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>The fire-resistance rating for walls or partitions consisting of two or more dissimilar wythes shall be permitted to be determined by the formula:</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170573\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170573\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>R = (R\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">0.59</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t + R\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">0.59</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t + . . . + R\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">n</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">0.59</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">1.7</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">(Equation 7-11)</span>&#160;</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170574\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170574\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>where: </div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170575\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170575\"></AnnotationDrawer><div><div style=\"\">&#160;&#160;&#160;R&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;The fire-resistance of the assembly (hours).</div></div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170576\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170576\"></AnnotationDrawer><div><div style=\"\">&#160;&#160;&#160;R\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">1</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t, R\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">2</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t and R\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">n</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>=&#160;&#160;&#160;The fire-resistance of the individual wythes (hours).</div></div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170577\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170577\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>Values for R\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">n</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">0.59</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t for use in Equation 7-11 are given in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-170513', hash: '#JD_BCTable722.4.1(3)' }}\">Table 722.4.1(3)</Link>.</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>","plainText":"The fire-resistance rating for walls or partitions consisting of two or more dissimilar wythes shall be permitted to be determined by the formula: R = (R 1 0.59 + R 2 0.59 + . . . + R n 0.59 ) 1.7 (Equation 7-11) where: R = The fire-resistance of the assembly (hours). R 1 , R 2 and R n = The fire-resistance of the individual wythes (hours). Values for R n 0.59 for use in Equation 7-11 are given in Table 722.4.1(3) ."}]}
